    "summary": "Each time an attack by one of this unit’s **POXWALKER** models destroys an enemy model other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** model, you can add 1 **destroyed** **POXWALKER** model back to this unit once this unit has finished resolving its attacks.\n\nWhile **TYPHUS** leads this unit, enemy models that **TYPHUS’** Eater Plague ability destroys count, for this ability, as destroyed by an attack from one of this unit’s **POXWALKER** models.",
